  (docker/cosmos-hdmap/Dockerfile); its render_from_rds_hq.py renders the
  HDMap condition videos on CPU.
- Eclipse SUMO (https://eclipse.dev/sumo/), Eclipse Public License 2.0
  (secondary license GPL-2.0-or-later). Installed from its official PyPI
  packages eclipse-sumo, traci and sumolib, pinned to 1.28.0
