- Python packages installed from PyPI and the PyTorch index (for example
  PyTorch, NumPy, WebDataset, FastAPI, Uvicorn, boto3, the Kubernetes Python
  client; the full list for the HDMap image is
  docker/cosmos-hdmap/requirements.lock.txt), and the Debian packages of the
  public.ecr.aws/docker/library/python base images, each under its own license.

